Hi {Owner},

I build websites for veterinary clinics around {City}. {Business Name} has warm reviews, but owners can't book a visit after hours, find a clear emergency page or read what your wellness plans include.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: online booking, an emergency and after-hours page, wellness plans, surgery day, refills and records, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

It makes no promises about outcomes, and pet photos only go up with owners' written consent. If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and updates. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes after appointments?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
